factorium-pointer-registry-delta-v0
extends proof-set-pointer-registry-v6.factorium
pointer allocation | Allocation | a structural label for assigning limited resources, capacity, work, or rights among recipients
pointer assessment | Assessment | a structural label for evaluating a subject against criteria, evidence, and intended use
pointer compensation | Compensation | a structural label for an adjustment, offset, payment, or balancing response
pointer correlation | Correlation | a structural label for a measured association that does not by itself establish causation
pointer disposition | Disposition | a structural label for a declared outcome, status, action, or handling decision
pointer energy | Energy | a structural label for physical energy quantity, transfer, storage, or availability in a model
pointer estimator | Estimator | a structural label for a rule or procedure that produces an estimate from observations
pointer force | Force | a structural label for physical interaction, compulsion, organized capability, influence, or validity
pointer function | Function | a structural label for a mapping, operation, expected role, or callable behavior in context
pointer information | Information | a structural label for content interpreted relative to a receiver, task, and context
pointer lifecycle | Lifecycle | a structural label for ordered states and transitions from creation through retirement
pointer loss | Loss | a structural label for omitted information, reduced value, failure, cost, or unrecovered difference
pointer period | Period | a structural label for a repeated-cycle duration, reporting span, or effective interval
pointer range | Range | a structural label for admissible values, operating extent, spatial reach, or output set
pointer record | Record | a structural label for a retained representation of an event, subject, state, or decision
pointer requirement | Requirement | a structural label for a necessary condition, capability, conduct, or result
pointer semantics | Semantics | a structural label for declared meaning, interpretation, and validity conditions of a representation
pointer shortage | Shortage | a structural label for demand or obligation exceeding available quantity, capacity, or supply
pointer transport | Transport | a structural label for movement of material, charge, information, or another quantity
pointer variable | Variable | a structural label for a named quantity or property whose value may differ across assignments
end-factorium-pointer-registry
